from coasts_author import *
compact('b281','以尺度相似、波列統計與量測鏈判讀海堤越波模型~Interpret seawall overtopping tests through scale similarity, wave statistics and measurement chains',r'''
弗勞德縮尺條件~Froude scaling conditions || 重力主導的自由液面試驗可保持弗勞德相似，使速度與時間按長度平方根縮放。黏滯、表面張力和含氣衝擊卻不能同時自動相似，縮小到細小水舌時必須重新檢查主導機制，避免只憑幾何比例接受模型。~Gravity-dominated free-surface tests can preserve Froude similarity, scaling velocity and time with the square root of length. Viscosity, surface tension and aerated impacts do not automatically remain similar; a thin model water tongue may therefore change the dominant physics despite geometrically accurate construction. || 假設原型對模型長度比25，原型波高5m、週期10s，模型為0.20m與10/√25=2s；只採重力相似。~Assume prototype:model length ratio25, prototype height5m and period10s. Model height is0.20m and period10/√25=2s under gravity similarity only. || 製作長度、時間與速度換算表，另以模型水深及速度估算雷諾數和韋伯數的量級。比較不同縮尺的關鍵輸出，記錄哪種現象不能由單一重力相似支持外推。~Prepare length, time and velocity conversions, then estimate Reynolds and Weber scales from model depth and speed. Compare critical outputs at different scales and record phenomena for which gravity similarity alone cannot justify extrapolation. || 若模型小到表面張力控制薄層水流，堤頂濺水與集水比例便可能偏離原型；幾何尺寸全部合格仍無法消除這種尺度效應，放大結果也不會自動恢復真實物理。~If surface tension dominates thin model flow, crest splashing and collected fractions differ from the prototype. Accurate geometry cannot eliminate that scale effect, and multiplying the result does not restore the missing physics. || 長度縮尺正確就代表所有越波及衝擊現象同時相似。~Correct length scaling makes every overtopping and impact process similar.
單寬流量換算~Unit-discharge conversion || 單寬越波流量的量綱是面積除時間，與整條海堤的總流量不同。重力相似下它按長度比的二分之三次方縮放，先辨清是否已除試驗寬度，才能避免額外乘一次長度比例造成嚴重誤差。~Unit-width overtopping discharge has dimensions of area per time and differs from total flow across a seawall. Under gravity similarity it scales with length to the three-halves power. Determine whether the measured quantity has already been divided by width before applying a second width conversion. || 假設長度比25、模型q=0.0004m²/s，原型q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m；不代表人員容許值。~Assume length ratio25 and model q=0.0004m²/s. Prototype q=25^1.5×0.0004=0.050m²/s=50L/s/m, not a pedestrian tolerance. || 把原始集水體積、試驗寬度與有效時間保存在同一紀錄中，分別計算總流量和單寬流量。再由另一人從基本量綱重建換算，確認圖表與資料檔的單位一致。~Keep collected volume, test width and valid duration together, calculating total and unit-width discharge separately. Have another reviewer reconstruct the conversion from dimensions and check that plots and exported tables use identical units. || 若把單寬量再按全流量的尺度放大，結果會系統性偏高；反向混用則可能低估外水負荷。圖表數值看似合理時，單位錯誤仍可一路傳入排水需求。~Scaling a unit-width quantity as total flow creates systematic overestimation; the reverse can understate loading. Plausible-looking plots may carry the unit error directly into drainage estimates unless the original dimensions remain visible. || 單寬越波量與全堤總流量可以使用同一縮尺指數。~Unit-width overtopping and total seawall flow use the same scale exponent.
集水控制體積~Collection control volume || 集水裝置量到的是進入特定容器的水，不一定等於全部跨越堤頂的水。側漏、濺出、槽內滯留與試驗結束後延遲排水都會破壞收支；控制體積及起訖時刻應先定義，再討論平均越波量。~A collection device measures water entering a particular container, not necessarily everything crossing the crest. Side leakage, splash loss, storage and delayed drainage disrupt the balance. Define the control volume and start/end times before interpreting the measurement as mean overtopping discharge. || 假設收集V=0.030m³、有效寬B=0.50m、時間120s，q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s；僅在收支閉合時成立。~Assume collected V=0.030m³, effective B=0.50m and duration120s. q=V/(Bt)=0.0005m²/s applies only to a closed collection balance. || 用已知水量做集水校準，記錄容器讀值、側漏與殘留，並分開波列有效段和後續排空時間。以另一種流量或重量量測交叉檢查，保留零越波與低於檢出限的區別。~Calibrate with known water input, recording tank reading, leakage and retention while separating the valid wave sequence from later drainage. Cross-check by weight or independent flow measurement and distinguish zero overtopping from values below detection limits. || 狹窄收集槽可能漏掉斜向越波，餘水又可能被算到下一組試驗；這兩種偏差可互相抵銷，使平均值看似穩定，卻無法支持不同斷面的可靠比較。~A narrow collector can miss oblique discharge while retained water enters the next test. Opposing biases may cancel in the mean, producing apparently stable results that do not support reliable comparison between sections. || 收集槽有讀值就代表所有越波水量都已被量到。~A collector reading proves that all overtopping water was measured.
不規則波能量~Irregular-wave energy || 不規則波需由波面紀錄建立能譜及統計量，單一最大波不能取代整段波列的代表波高。頻帶截取、漂移去除和量測位置會改變零階譜矩，需記清處理方法，才能把造波設定與入射波條件對上。~Irregular waves require a surface-elevation record, spectrum and statistical description. One maximum wave cannot replace a representative height for the sequence. Frequency limits, detrending and measurement location alter the zero-order spectral moment, so processing must remain traceable when comparing generator settings with incident conditions. || 假設零階譜矩m0=0.0025m²，Hm0=4√m0=0.20m；m0增10%時波高乘√1.1而非1.1。~Assume zero-order moment m0=0.0025m². Hm0=4√m0=0.20m; increasing m0 by10% multiplies height by√1.1, not1.1. || 保留原始波面時間序列及處理參數，檢查取樣頻率、有效頻帶與漂移移除是否一致。用時域波高分布交叉比較譜波高，並列出兩者定義差異而非強迫相等。~Retain raw elevation and processing parameters, checking sample rate, retained frequencies and detrending consistently. Compare spectral height with the time-domain wave-height distribution, documenting their differing definitions instead of forcing numerical agreement. || 感測器慢漂移若被當成低頻波能，譜矩會被抬高；另一方面過度濾波可能刪掉真實長週期能量。相同造波設定不能保證處理後的有效波況相同。~Slow sensor drift mistaken for wave energy inflates the spectral moment, while aggressive filtering removes genuine long-period energy. Identical generator settings therefore do not guarantee equivalent effective wave conditions after processing. || 最大單波高度就是能譜有效波高的另一種寫法。~Maximum individual wave height is another name for spectral significant height.
相對出水高度~Relative crest freeboard || 越波對堤頂相對水面的高度十分敏感，潮位、增水及基準偏差都會改變有效出水高。比較試驗時必須區分堤頂變化和靜水面變化，兩者在幾何上可能等效，但對前灘水深與破波位置的影響不同。~Overtopping responds strongly to crest level relative to still water. Tide, surge and datum bias alter effective freeboard. Crest adjustment and water-level change can produce the same nominal freeboard while changing foreshore depth and breaking location differently, so the complete geometry must be retained. || 假設Rc=0.10m、Hm0=0.20m，比值Rc/Hm0=0.50；水位上升0.02m且堤頂不變時比值為0.40。~Assume Rc=0.10m and Hm0=0.20m, giving Rc/Hm0=0.50. Raising water0.02m at fixed crest changes the ratio to0.40. || 從同一高程基準量取堤頂和靜水面，將量測不確定度與波況一同列入試驗矩陣。重做水位改變時需重新校準結構前的入射波，檢查是否同時改變破波型態。~Measure crest and still water from one datum and include level uncertainty alongside wave conditions in the test matrix. Recalibrate incident waves before the structure after changing water level, checking for a simultaneous change in breaking regime. || 模型底板沉陷或水位零點偏移會讓標稱出水高失真，越波量變化可能因此被誤認為新堤型較好；只校核堤頂尺寸而忽略水面基準無法辨識原因。~Settlement of the model base or water-level zero drift corrupts nominal freeboard. The resulting discharge change may be mistaken for an improved wall geometry, and checking crest dimensions alone will not reveal the cause. || 相同出水高比值必然代表相同前灘破波與越波結果。~Equal relative freeboard guarantees identical foreshore breaking and overtopping.
入射反射分離~Incident-reflected wave separation || 結構反射與入射波疊加形成空間起伏，單點量測可能剛好位在節點或腹點。要把試驗與設計入射波連結，需用適當測點配置和分離方法；反射振幅比也不能直接當成反射能量比。~Reflected and incident waves create spatial interference, so a single gauge may sit near a node or antinode. Appropriate gauge geometry and separation are needed to recover incident conditions. An amplitude reflection coefficient also differs from the associated energy fraction under matched propagation conditions. || 假設分離得到入射振幅0.50m、反射0.20m，Kr=0.40；同介質同頻率下反射能量比約Kr²=0.16。~Assume separated incident and reflected amplitudes0.50m and0.20m. Kr=0.40; for matched medium and frequency the reflected energy fraction is approximately0.16. || 先在無結構或已知反射條件下驗證分離方法，檢查測點距離相對波長是否合適。用多組距離重算結果並記錄無法可靠分離的頻帶，避免只報一個漂亮係數。~Verify separation against absent or known reflection, checking gauge spacing against wavelength. Recompute using alternative gauge combinations and identify frequency bands with unreliable separation rather than reporting only one attractive overall coefficient. || 測點間距落在病態幾何時，微小讀值誤差會被放大成不合理反射；若再用錯誤入射波高歸一化越波量，兩個分析步驟會共同偏離真實條件。~Ill-conditioned gauge spacing magnifies small reading errors into unrealistic reflection. Normalizing discharge with the resulting wrong incident height compounds the error across two analysis stages, even when both outputs appear smoothly varying. || 反射振幅百分之四十就表示反射了百分之四十能量。~Forty percent reflected amplitude means forty percent reflected energy.
取樣頻帶配置~Sampling bandwidth selection || 波面和衝擊壓力的時間尺度不同，能記錄主波週期的頻率不一定能捕捉短暫壓峰。取樣前的類比濾波與感測器自身頻率響應同樣重要，事後加密插值只能增加點數，無法回復已混疊或漏掉的訊號。~Surface elevation and impact pressure occupy different timescales. Sampling sufficient for the main wave period may miss brief pressure peaks. Analog filtering and sensor response matter before digitization; interpolating afterward increases sample count without recovering aliased or absent information. || 假設取樣20Hz，理想奈奎斯特頻率10Hz；週期2s波有40點，但不能據此保證毫秒衝擊峰值準確。~Assume sampling20Hz: ideal Nyquist frequency is10Hz and a2s wave has40 points. This does not establish accuracy for millisecond impact peaks. || 分別為波面、集水量與衝擊設定需求頻帶，確認感測器與擷取器整條量測鏈。以已知快變訊號檢查峰值與相位，保留抗混疊設定及原始時間戳供重算。~Specify bandwidth separately for elevation, collection and impacts, checking the complete sensor-acquisition chain. Use a known rapidly changing signal to assess peak and phase response, retaining anti-alias settings and raw timestamps for reconstruction. || 過低頻率會漏掉短峰，過高頻率若未控制電噪音又可能產生假峰。平滑後的波形不等於可信波形，將其當結構設計荷載前仍須確認頻率響應。~Low sampling misses short peaks, while uncontrolled electrical noise at high rates creates false ones. A smooth trace is not automatically credible, and structural load interpretation still requires demonstrated frequency response of the measurement chain. || 每個主波週期有很多點就能保證任何壓力峰值可靠。~Many samples per main wave guarantee reliable measurement of every pressure peak.
堤頂水舌流態~Crest-flow regime || 跨堤水舌具有局部水深與速度，平均單寬流量無法唯一決定兩者。弗勞德數可比較慣性與重力尺度，但不含人員失衡、漂浮物及脈動衝擊；同一平均越波量仍可能對應很不同的瞬間流況。~A crest water tongue has local depth and velocity that mean unit discharge cannot uniquely determine. The Froude number compares inertia with gravity but excludes pedestrian instability, debris and impulsive loading. Equal mean overtopping can therefore conceal very different instantaneous flow regimes at the crest. || 假設局部v=2m/s、h=0.30m，Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17；這是局部流態指標，不是通行安全判定。~Assume local v=2m/s and h=0.30m. Fr=v/√(gh)=1.17 is a local flow-regime indicator, not an access-safety decision. || 同步量測水深與速度而非分別取各自最大值，檢查儀器在含氣薄層中的有效性。用影像核對水舌範圍及持續時間，並把局部資料和整段平均流量分開呈現。~Measure depth and velocity simultaneously instead of combining unrelated maxima, checking sensor validity in shallow aerated flow. Use video to confirm tongue extent and duration, presenting local measurements separately from whole-sequence mean discharge. || 水深與速度不同步會產生根本未發生的極端組合，含氣又可能讓讀值失真。只報單一弗勞德數會掩蓋持續時間與空間分布，無法支撐通行或構造安全宣稱。~Unsynchronized depth and velocity create extreme combinations that never occurred, while air distorts measurements. One Froude value hides duration and spatial distribution and cannot establish public access or structural safety by itself. || 弗勞德數小於某一數字就能直接開放海堤通行。~A Froude value below one chosen number directly permits seawall access.
重複試驗變異~Repeated-test variability || 相同能譜可以由不同隨機相位波列實現，少數大波會影響集水平均與最大事件。重複試驗應涵蓋波列變異，而不只是重讀同一段資料；平均值的不確定度也不等於單次事件分散程度。~The same spectrum can be realized through different random-phase sequences, and a few large waves influence collected means and maxima. Repeats should sample sequence variability rather than reread identical data. Uncertainty of the mean differs from the spread of individual events or test outcomes. || 假設三次q為0.4、0.5、0.6L/s/m，平均0.5、樣本標準差0.1，獨立時平均標準誤0.1/√3=0.0577；樣本僅3。~Assume q=0.4,0.5,0.6L/s/m: mean0.5, sample deviation0.1 and independent-mean standard error0.0577. Only3 realizations are represented. || 記錄每次隨機種子、有效波數與試驗長度，分別比較平均越波與個別大事件。檢查樣本是否真正獨立，並在報告列出原始三次結果，避免只留下不確定度最小的組合。~Record random seed, valid wave count and duration for every run, comparing mean discharge and large events separately. Check genuine independence and report the original realizations instead of retaining only the combination with the smallest apparent uncertainty. || 重用同一波列再把它當獨立樣本會虛增有效樣本數，標準誤因此過小；刪除一次較大越波結果更會直接扭曲工程所關心的尾部行為與風險。~Reusing one wave sequence as independent observations inflates sample size and understates standard error. Removing a high-discharge realization further distorts the tail behavior that matters for the engineering interpretation of unusually severe events. || 重播同一段波列三次等於取得三組獨立海況樣本。~Replaying one wave sequence three times gives three independent sea-state samples.
局部荷載與平均量~Local load versus mean flow || 越波平均量適合描述一段時間的水量，但堤後構件可能由短時局部衝擊控制。力、壓力和受力面積必須區分，壓力感測器的空間平均也會抹去小範圍峰值；不能由流量合格推論所有附屬構件合格。~Mean overtopping describes water quantity over time, whereas a rear-side element may be governed by a brief localized impact. Distinguish force, pressure and loaded area; spatial averaging by a pressure sensor also smooths small peaks. Passing a discharge criterion does not qualify every secondary component. || 假設均勻瞬時合力100N作用於0.020m²平板，p=F/A=5kPa；不代表其他面積或非均勻衝擊峰值。~Assume a uniform instantaneous100N resultant on a0.020m² plate. p=F/A=5kPa does not represent another area or a nonuniform impact peak. || 以已知荷載校準整個受力裝置，核對壓力積分與獨立力計結果。保存感測面積、取樣頻率及載重方向，並檢查附屬構件的實際邊界是否與模型平板相同。~Calibrate the full force assembly with known loading and compare integrated pressure with an independent force sensor. Retain sensor area, sampling rate and load direction, checking whether the actual secondary element shares the model plate's support conditions. || 小面積衝擊被平均到大面積後可能低估局部破壞，裝置自振又可能製造額外峰值。若只存最大數字而不存時間歷程，便無法分辨水力作用與儀器反應。~Averaging a small impact over a large area understates local damage, while rig vibration adds artificial peaks. Retaining only a maximum value prevents separation of the hydraulic event from the instrument response that followed it. || 平均越波量通過後堤後欄杆與面板的衝擊荷載也已通過。~Acceptable mean overtopping also qualifies impact loads on rear railings and panels.
''')
coastal_meta('b281','假設長度比由25增10%為27.5，固定原型週期10s時模型週期由2降為1.9069s，下降約4.65%；不能把時間也直接縮小10%。~Increasing length ratio from25 to27.5 by10% at fixed prototype period10s changes model period from2 to1.9069s, about4.65% lower; time does not change by10%.')

compact('b282','連結塊石質量、層次幾何、基床與施工量測以理解拋石防波堤~Understand rubble-mound breakwaters through stone mass, layered geometry, foundations and construction measurements',r'''
水下有效重量~Submerged effective weight || 塊石在水下抵抗移動的重量應扣除浮力，材料密度與海水密度共同決定有效重度。含孔隙岩石的吸水狀態和外包體積定義需一致，乾石秤重不能不經轉換就代表水下作用。~Stone resistance underwater depends on weight minus buoyancy, with both rock and water density controlling effective unit weight. Absorption state and external volume definition must be consistent; a dry weighing result is not directly the submerged action. || 假設岩石密度2650kg/m³、海水1025kg/m³、排水體積2m³，W′=(2650−1025)×9.81×2=31.8825kN。~Assume rock density2650kg/m³, seawater1025kg/m³ and displaced volume2m³. W′=(2650−1025)×9.81×2=31.8825kN. || 將石料質量、吸水狀態與體積量測配對，另核對海水密度的取樣條件。以獨立浮力或密度試驗驗證，並保留個別塊石資料而非只報整批平均。~Pair stone mass with absorption state and measured volume, checking seawater sampling conditions. Verify through independent buoyancy or density testing and retain individual records instead of only a batch average. || 若把鬆方堆積體積當成單塊排水體積，孔隙水會被錯算為石料；平均密度看似合理卻可掩蓋弱石和多孔石，造成水下抗力估計系統性偏高。~Using bulk stockpile volume as individual displaced volume counts void water as stone. A plausible average can conceal weak porous pieces and systematically overestimate underwater resistance throughout the placed layer. || 同樣乾重量的石塊在任何水體中都有相同水下重量。~Equal dry stone weights imply equal submerged weights in every water body.
無因次穩定指標~Dimensionless stability indicator || 波高與有效密度及標稱石徑的比值可組織不同試驗的量級，但本身不包含坡度、波週期、透水性與容許損傷。穩定指標只能在相應實驗關係的適用範圍內解釋，不能自訂一個數字就決定石料規格。~Wave height relative to effective density and nominal diameter organizes test scales but omits slope, period, permeability and damage definition. Interpret this indicator within the relevant empirical relation; choosing a convenient number alone cannot establish an armour specification. || 假設Δ=2650/1025−1=1.5854、H=3m、Dn=1m，Ns=H/(ΔDn)=1.892；此處沒有指定合格門檻。~Assume Δ=2650/1025−1=1.5854, H=3m and Dn=1m. Ns=H/(ΔDn)=1.892; no acceptance threshold is assigned. || 把波高定義、週期、坡度、層數與損傷指標列成試驗對照表，查明採用關係的校準範圍。再以現地材料形狀和模型層次檢查哪些條件並不相同。~Tabulate wave-height definition, period, slope, layers and damage metric against the calibration range of the chosen relation. Compare actual rock shapes and model layering to identify conditions that differ. || 把不同波高定義或不同損傷標準的資料混用，會讓同一穩定數代表不同風險；外觀相似的石坡仍可能因透水性和波週期差異而有不同移動模式。~Mixing wave-height definitions or damage criteria makes one stability number represent different risks. Similar-looking slopes can still develop different movement patterns because their permeability and wave periods are different. || 相同穩定數就能不看坡度與週期直接採用相同石重。~The same stability number permits identical stone mass regardless of slope and period.
堆積孔隙與耗能~Packing porosity and dissipation || 護面與堤心孔隙影響水流穿透、壓力釋放與能量耗散，孔隙率卻不是越大越好。級配、形狀和安放方式決定連通性；相同總孔隙體積可能形成截然不同的通道與局部流速。~Armour and core voids influence penetration, pressure relief and energy loss, but more porosity is not automatically better. Grading, shape and placement govern connectivity; equal total void volume can produce very different flow paths and local velocities. || 假設堆體100m³內石料實體60m³，孔隙率n=(100−60)/100=0.40；孔隙比e=40/60=0.667，兩者不同。~Assume100m³ bulk volume contains60m³ solids. Porosity n=0.40 and void ratio e=40/60=0.667 are different quantities. || 由已知石料密度與質量獨立估算實體體積，對照測量堆體外形所得總體積。記錄級配和施工位置，另以透流試驗檢查孔隙是否連通而非只做體積統計。~Estimate solid volume independently from mass and density and compare it with surveyed bulk geometry. Record grading and placement location, checking connected flow through testing rather than volume statistics alone. || 細料塞入孔隙會改變內部壓力而未必明顯改變外觀，隨意壓實又可能破壞設計透水性；若只看堆體高度，便無法判斷內部水力功能是否保留。~Fines clog voids and alter internal pressure without obvious external change. Uncontrolled compaction can remove intended permeability, while crest-level surveys alone cannot establish whether internal hydraulic function has been preserved. || 孔隙率與孔隙比只是同一比例的兩種名稱。~Porosity and void ratio are simply two names for the same fraction.
坡面幾何放樣~Slope geometry setting-out || 水下坡面放樣要區分垂直高度、水平投影與斜面長度，測深資料還需回到共同高程基準。邊坡外形控制材料量和護面連續性，名義坡比正確不表示坡腳與轉折位置都已符合實際斷面。~Underwater setting-out distinguishes vertical height, horizontal run and slope length while referencing soundings to one datum. Profile geometry controls material quantity and armour continuity; the nominal slope ratio alone does not confirm toe or transition locations. || 假設坡比1垂直比2水平、高10m，水平投影20m、斜面長√(10²+20²)=22.36m；不是20m斜長。~Assume a1V:2H slope with10m rise. Horizontal run is20m and slope length√(10²+20²)=22.36m, not20m. || 用剖面點重建垂直與水平坐標，檢查潮位、船體姿態和探頭偏置的修正。另在坡腳與堤頂增加測線，避免只用中間一條斜線判定整段層厚。~Reconstruct profile coordinates and check tide, vessel attitude and transducer-offset corrections. Add survey lines at toe and crest rather than using one central slope line to infer layer thickness everywhere. || 把斜長當水平距離會使石料數量和安放位置同時偏差，坡腳缺料又可能被高處多料掩蓋；平均斷面面積相同仍無法保證局部支承連續。~Confusing slope length with horizontal run shifts both quantities and placement. Excess material higher up can hide a deficient toe, so equal average cross-sectional area does not prove continuous local support. || 只要平均坡比正確就不必另外檢查坡腳位置。~A correct average slope makes separate toe-position checks unnecessary.
反濾相容判讀~Filter compatibility interpretation || 反濾層要限制細料流失並允許排水，保土與透水兩個目標必須一起考慮。粒徑比只是選用準則中的一部分，基土是否分散、級配是否間斷以及波浪反向流都會影響可用性。~Filters must retain finer material while allowing drainage, so retention and permeability are joint objectives. Grain-size ratios are only part of a selected criterion; dispersive soil, gap grading and reversing wave flow can change applicability substantially. || 假設濾料D15=4mm、基料d85=1mm，比值D15/d85=4；只示範粒徑比，不宣稱符合所有反濾準則。~Assume filter D15=4mm and base d85=1mm, giving ratio4. This illustrates the ratio without claiming compliance with every filter criterion. || 分別取得基料與濾料完整級配曲線，核對粒徑符號和試驗方法。採用具適用性的保土與透水判據，再以實際流向和材料狀態檢查需要的相容性試驗。~Obtain complete grading curves for base and filter and verify percentile definitions and test methods. Apply appropriate retention and permeability criteria, then assess compatibility testing against actual flow reversals and material condition. || 只挑一個粒徑比合格會漏掉基土被沖走或排水受阻的另一端風險；施工分離造成局部級配改變時，料場檢驗合格也不能證明現地整層有效。~Passing one grain-size ratio can miss either base-material loss or blocked drainage. Segregation during placement changes local grading, so quarry compliance does not establish that the full installed filter remains effective. || 任意基土只要粒徑比等於四就必然滿足反濾要求。~A grain-size ratio of four automatically satisfies filter requirements for every base soil.
標稱石徑與形狀~Nominal diameter and shape || 標稱石徑是由石塊體積換算的立方體尺度，不是最長邊或篩孔尺寸。扁長石可能有相同質量卻較容易受力翻轉，故尺寸換算需和形狀、裂隙及安放接觸一起判讀。~Nominal diameter is the cube-root volume scale, not the longest axis or sieve opening. Slender stones of equal mass may rotate differently under loading, so conversion must be interpreted with shape, fractures and contact arrangement rather than as a complete stability description. || 假設石重M=5000kg、密度ρ=2650kg/m³，Dn=(M/ρ)^(1/3)=1.2357m；不是石塊最大邊長。~Assume mass M=5000kg and densityρ=2650kg/m³. Dn=(M/ρ)^(1/3)=1.2357m is not the stone's maximum dimension. || 對代表性石塊同時量質量、三主軸與裂隙，從密度換算標稱徑後保留原始形狀資料。比較合格級配內的扁長比例，並檢查安放後接觸是否符合設計假設。~Measure representative mass, three axes and fractures together, retaining shape data after converting nominal diameter. Compare slenderness within the accepted grading and check whether installed contacts match the intended arrangement. || 只按噸數驗收可能把扁薄裂石當成等效方塊，吊運和波浪作用下的破碎風險因而被忽略；石塊破裂後級配與孔隙也會一併改變而影響內部排水。~Mass-only acceptance can treat thin fractured pieces as equivalent cubes and overlook breakage during lifting or waves. Fragmentation then changes grading and voids as well as the original external armour geometry. || 標稱石徑一樣表示塊石形狀與翻轉阻力也相同。~Equal nominal diameter implies equal shape and resistance to overturning.
流速造成阻力~Current-induced drag || 波浪軌道流與潮流會對外露石塊產生阻力，受力取決於瞬時相對速度及投影面積。簡化定常阻力式不含加速度慣性、遮蔽與紊流尖峰，不能把單一算值直接當作石塊的完整設計荷載。~Wave orbital motion and currents impose drag according to instantaneous relative velocity and projected area. A steady drag estimate omits acceleration forces, sheltering and turbulent peaks, so one calculated value is not the complete design action on an exposed stone. || 假設ρ=1025kg/m³、Cd=1、投影A=2m²、定常v=2m/s，F=ρCdAv²/2=4100N=4.1kN。~Assumeρ=1025kg/m³, Cd=1, projected A=2m² and steady v=2m/s. F=ρCdAv²/2=4100N=4.1kN. || 定義相對流速方向與投影面積，說明阻力係數採用條件及未包含的慣性項。用局部速度量測或水工模型檢查遮蔽差異，保留峰值和平均值的分別。~Define relative-flow direction and projected area, documenting the drag-coefficient conditions and omitted inertia term. Check sheltering through local velocity measurements or hydraulic models and keep peak and mean values distinct. || 速度若用平均值代替瞬間峰值，平方關係會放大低估；石塊移動後暴露面積又可能增大。固定幾何的簡式因而無法描述持續移動與鄰石失穩的連鎖反應。~Replacing instantaneous speed with its mean can strongly understate squared-velocity loading. Movement may expose additional area, so a fixed-geometry estimate cannot represent progressive displacement and the resulting loss of neighboring support. || 流速增加百分之十時阻力也只會增加百分之十。~A ten-percent increase in speed produces only ten-percent more drag.
基床沉陷與層厚~Foundation settlement and thickness || 拋石堤的基床變形會改變坡腳與堤頂高程，也會重新分配護面接觸。平均壓縮應變可估量沉陷，但不能代表差異沉陷或循環孔壓引起的軟化，施工分期與海床土性必須一起記錄。~Foundation deformation changes toe and crest elevations and redistributes armour contacts. Average compression strain estimates settlement but does not represent differential movement or cyclic pore-pressure softening. Construction stages must therefore be interpreted together with seabed conditions and their evolution. || 假設厚H=3m的單層均勻垂直應變0.02，s=εH=0.060m；未包含其他土層或差異沉陷。~Assume a3m layer with uniform vertical strain0.02. Settlement s=εH=0.060m excludes other layers and differential movement. || 在相同基準下追蹤多個剖面的高程與施工荷載，將即時變形和後續變形分開。核對壓縮層厚度及地下水條件，避免把石堆重排和地基壓縮混成同一機制。~Track elevations across several profiles against construction loading using one datum, separating immediate and delayed movement. Verify compressible-layer thickness and groundwater conditions, distinguishing stone rearrangement from deformation of the underlying foundation. || 基床局部下陷可能先讓濾層拉開而不是整堤明顯下沉，外觀仍完整時內部已可流失細料；只用堤頂平均沉陷容易漏掉最需要維修的區域。~Localized foundation movement can open the filter before large crest settlement becomes visible. Fine material may escape beneath an intact-looking surface, and average crest movement can miss the area most in need of intervention. || 堤頂平均沉陷很小就代表基床與反濾層沒有局部損傷。~Small average crest settlement proves no local foundation or filter damage exists.
吊索角度與受力~Sling angle and force || 拋石安放常涉及吊具或抓斗，但載重分配不是把總重平均除以吊索數就結束。索向與垂直方向的角度會改變張力，重心偏移、動態加速度及吊點強度仍需由核准吊裝方案處理。~Stone placement can involve slings or grabs, but force sharing is not simply weight divided by sling count. Angle from the vertical changes tension, while center-of-gravity offset, dynamic acceleration and attachment capacity still require an approved lifting analysis. || 假設靜態重量100kN由兩索對稱承擔，各與垂直夾30°，T=100/(2cos30°)=57.74kN；不含動載。~Assume static100kN shared symmetrically by two slings each30° from vertical. T=100/(2cos30°)=57.74kN, excluding dynamic loading. || 在示意圖標明角度相對垂直或水平的定義，驗算垂直分力和水平分力平衡。另列吊具能力、重心與動載條件，讓教學靜力值不被誤用為現場吊裝設定。~Label whether angles reference vertical or horizontal and verify both force components. Separately document rig capacity, center of gravity and dynamic conditions so the teaching equilibrium result cannot become a field lifting setting. || 角度定義弄反會使張力估算大幅錯誤，海上吊運的加速度又可能超出靜態值；若只查總重量而忽略索力與吊點，系統最弱介面可能先行破壞。~Reversing the angle convention greatly changes predicted tension, while offshore acceleration exceeds static loading. Checking total weight without sling and attachment forces can leave the weakest interface unrecognized until it governs failure. || 兩條索永遠各承受總重量的一半而不受角度影響。~Two slings always carry half the weight regardless of their angle.
損傷斷面與追蹤~Damage profiles and tracking || 暴風後護面位移要用固定測區和基準比較，表面凹陷、坡腳隆起與真正石料流失不相同。損傷面積可以組織觀測，但需要搭配位置和時序，避免把移位後仍在斷面內的石塊誤算成完全流失。~Post-storm armour movement needs fixed survey areas and datums. Surface depressions, toe accumulation and actual material loss differ. A damage-area measure organizes observations only when location and chronology remain available, preventing displaced stones still within the section from being counted as entirely lost. || 假設同一斷面受損面積Ae=8m²、Dn=1m，無因次S=Ae/Dn²=8；這不是百分之八損傷。~Assume damage area Ae=8m² in one section and Dn=1m. Dimensionless S=Ae/Dn²=8 is not eight-percent damage. || 明確定義受損面積的基準線與積分範圍，重測坡腳和堤頂並保留暴風前後影像。將石塊位移、破碎與反濾外露分開記錄，再與設計採用的損傷定義比較。~Define the baseline and integration limits for damage area, resurvey toe and crest and retain before/after imagery. Record displacement, breakage and exposed filter separately before comparing with the design's chosen damage definition. || 若每次測量都換基準或範圍，損傷指標可能下降但實際弱點擴大；局部反濾裸露也可能在整段平均面積中被稀釋，延誤辨識進一步流失的起點。~Changing datum or survey extent can make the index decrease while a weak area expands. Local filter exposure may also disappear in section-wide averaging, delaying recognition of the starting point for further material loss. || 無因次損傷數等於百分比，可以直接乘一百解讀。~A dimensionless damage number is a percentage that can be multiplied by one hundred.
''')
coastal_meta('b282','假設排水體積由2增10%至2.2m³、兩種密度固定，水下有效重量由31.8825增至35.07075kN；此線性增加不代表波浪穩定能力必定增加10%，因形狀與接觸可能改變。~Increasing displaced volume from2 to2.2m³ by10% at fixed densities changes effective weight from31.8825 to35.07075kN. Wave stability does not necessarily improve by10%, because shape and contact can change.')
if __name__=='__main__':generate()
